<overview>
<p>The Free Worlds League Military has long fielded some of the largest infantry formations in the Inner Sphere, with regiments numbering nearly 1,800 soldiers compared to roughly 750 in the Combine and just over 1,000 in the Federated Suns. Towing crew-served LB 20-X autocannon, these platoons combine devastating short-range stopping power with the option of cluster munitions, making them equally dangerous to armored vehicles and massed infantry.</p>
</overview>

<notes>
Intro date based on common production date of LBX autocannon
</notes>

